    "VersionName": "0.2.1",
    "FriendlyName": "Voice Turn Pipeline",
    "Description": "Voice-turn WebSocket client component: text + audio WebSocket channels, low-latency push-to-talk capture and TTS playback (miniaudio/WASAPI), and the generic voice-turn wire protocol. Host games plug in their own auth (token provider delegate) and their own server events (unhandled-event delegate). Windows only.",
    "Category": "Audio",
